# HAL wiring for the buscheck GladeVCP tab.
# Passed to gladevcp via -H, so it runs AFTER the buscheck.* pins exist.
#
# Bridges the bus state into the operator Stoermeldungen queue via the three
# bus fault-latch instances (IDs 100/101/102 = faultlatch.0/1/2), which are
# created (loadrt faultlatch) in faulthandler.hal BEFORE the GUI. buscheck
# ok-pins are HIGH = ok, exactly what faultlatch.monitor expects.

net bus-alive     buscheck.bus-alive       => faultlatch.0.monitor
net bus-complete  buscheck.slaves-complete => faultlatch.1.monitor
net bus-all-op    buscheck.all-op          => faultlatch.2.monitor
